{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive Shopify package comparison section that closely matches the attached reference image. Match its clean layout, typography, colors, table proportions, and spacing.
    
    HEADER
    - White section background.
    - Centered container with an editable maximum width, default 1440px.
    - Desktop padding: approximately 48px top and bottom, 40px side gutters.
    - Small bold uppercase eyebrow at the top left: “THE DETAILS, MADE SIMPLE”.
    - Below it, a large regular-weight heading: “Find your perfect fit.”
    - Heading size: approximately 46px desktop and 32px mobile, dark charcoal.
    - On the right, aligned near the heading baseline, show a muted gray link: “Have a question? Read the FAQs ↗”.
    - Make the FAQ link text and destination editable.
    - Leave approximately 30px between the heading and the comparison table.
    
    COMPARISON TABLE
    - Create one continuous table with four columns:
      “What’s included”, “Launch”, “Growth”, “Scale”.
    - First column occupies approximately 31% of the table width; the other three columns share the remaining width equally.
    - Left-align the first column and center-align all package columns.
    - Use a pale blue-gray header background, approximately #DFE7EC.
    - Highlight the entire Growth column with a slightly lighter pale blue-gray background, approximately #E7EEF5, including its header and every body cell.
    - Keep all other body cells white.
    - Thin warm light-gray horizontal borders between rows, approximately #DEDFD8.
    - Add a subtle outer border and approximately 6px outer corner radius.
    - No shadows, gradients, icons, buttons, alternating row colors, or hover effects.
    - Use dark charcoal text with clean sans-serif typography.
    - Header labels and first-column row labels should be bold.
    - Body text should be regular weight, approximately 14px.
    - Use approximately 16px horizontal cell padding and 18px vertical padding.
    - Rows should be approximately 58px tall, expanding naturally when text wraps.
    - Keep borders and highlighted backgrounds continuous without gaps.
    
    PREFILL THESE TABLE ROWS
    Use the following values in this exact column order:
    Feature | Launch | Growth | Scale
    
    Project investment | $1,000 | $3,000 | $10,000
    Design approach | Branded premium theme | Customized theme templates | Bespoke UI & sections
    Products loaded | Up to 25 | Up to 150 via CSV | Unlimited via bulk import
    Pages | 4 pages | Up to 8 | 20+ (scope confirmed)
    App setup | 1 app | Up to 3 apps | Up to 8 + integrations
    Email marketing | Basic notifications | 2 Klaviyo flows | Full Klaviyo flow suite
    Migration | Available as add-on | Products & customers | Products, customers & orders
    SEO | Titles & meta descriptions | On-page, redirects & sitemap | Technical audit, schema & mapping
    Revision rounds | 1 | 2 | 3
    Post-launch support | 7 days | Confirm in proposal | 60 days
    Dedicated project manager | — | — | Included
    Estimated timeline | 1–2 weeks | 3–5 weeks | 8–12 weeks
    
    FOOTNOTE
    Below the table, add small muted gray text, left-aligned:
    “Custom checkout capabilities depend on your Shopify plan and platform eligibility. ‘20+ pages’ and custom integrations are scoped during discovery.”
    Use approximately 12px text with 16–20px space above it.
    
    MOBILE BEHAVIOR
    - Use approximately 20px section side gutters.
    - Stack the FAQ link below the heading and align it left.
    - Preserve the comparison table layout using horizontal scrolling within the table container.
    - Set a suitable minimum table width of approximately 800px so text remains readable.
    - Keep the first column sticky while scrolling horizontally.
    - Preserve white backgrounds on sticky body cells and the header background on the sticky header cell.
    - Ensure the table scrolls without making the entire page overflow.
    - Keep the Growth column highlight visible throughout.
    
    SHOPIFY EDITOR SETTINGS
    - Make the eyebrow, heading, FAQ text, FAQ link, column titles, and footnote editable.
    - Use repeatable row blocks, each with four text fields: feature name, Launch value, Growth value, Scale value.
    - Prefill all 12 rows with the content above.
    - Allow rows to be added, removed, and reordered.
    - Add controls for section background, text color, header background, highlighted column background, border color, and highlighted column selection.
    - Add desktop and mobile heading sizes, table text size, maximum width, cell padding, and section padding settings.
    - Use valid Shopify schema defaults and range increments.
    - Scope all styles to this section.
    - Use semantic table markup with proper column headers and row headers.
    - Prioritize matching the attached reference rather than introducing additional design elements.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:{{ block.settings.section_bg }}; color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}; padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 20px; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:100%; max-width:{{ block.settings.max_width }}px; margin:0 auto; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; gap:24px; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin:0 0 12px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin:0; font-size:{{ block.settings.heading_desktop }}px; line-height:1.12; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq { color:#74797c; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__scroll { width:100%; overflow-x:auto; margin-top:30px; border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius:6px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table { border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0; width:100%; min-width:800px; table-layout:fixed; font-size:{{ block.settings.table_text_size }}px; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table th, .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table td { padding:{{ block.settings.cell_padding }}px 16px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; border-bottom:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; font-weight:400; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table thead th { background:{{ block.settings.header_bg }}; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table tbody th { text-align:left; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table tr:last-child th, .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table tr:last-child td { border-bottom:0; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table th:first-child, .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table td:first-child { width:31%; text-align:left; position:sticky; left:0; z-index:2; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table thead th:first-child { background:{{ block.settings.header_bg }}; z-index:4; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table tbody th { background:{{ block.settings.section_bg }}; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight { background:{{ block.settings.highlight_bg }}; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table thead .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight { background:{{ block.settings.highlight_bg }}; }
  .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footnote { margin:16px 0 0; color:#74797c; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; }
  @media (max-width:749px) {
    .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:32px 20px; }
    .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top { display:block; }
    .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size:{{ block.settings.heading_mobile }}px; }
    .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq { display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; }
    .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table th:first-child, .ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table td:first-child { width:220px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:100%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top">
      <div><p class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2></div>
      {% if block.settings.faq_text != blank %}<a class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq" href="{{ block.settings.faq_link }}">{{ block.settings.faq_text | escape }}</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% assign highlight = block.settings.highlight_column %}
    <div class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__scroll" role="region" aria-label="Package comparison table" tabindex="0">
      <table class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">{{ block.settings.first_title | escape }}</th><th scope="col" {% if highlight == 'launch' %}class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight"{% endif %}>{{ block.settings.launch_title | escape }}</th><th scope="col" {% if highlight == 'growth' %}class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight"{% endif %}>{{ block.settings.growth_title | escape }}</th><th scope="col" {% if highlight == 'scale' %}class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight"{% endif %}>{{ block.settings.scale_title | escape }}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for i in (1..12) %}
            {% assign feature_key = 'feature_' | append: i %}{% assign launch_key = 'launch_' | append: i %}{% assign growth_key = 'growth_' | append: i %}{% assign scale_key = 'scale_' | append: i %}
            <tr><th scope="row">{{ block.settings[feature_key] | escape }}</th><td {% if highlight == 'launch' %}class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight"{% endif %}>{{ block.settings[launch_key] | escape }}</td><td {% if highlight == 'growth' %}class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight"{% endif %}>{{ block.settings[growth_key] | escape }}</td><td {% if highlight == 'scale' %}class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__highlight"{% endif %}>{{ block.settings[scale_key] | escape }}</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="ai-package-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footnote">{{ block.settings.footnote | escape }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Package comparison",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"THE DETAILS, MADE SIMPLE"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Find your perfect fit."},
    {"type":"text","id":"faq_text","label":"FAQ link text","default":"Have a question? Read the FAQs ↗"},
    {"type":"url","id":"faq_link","label":"FAQ link"},
    {"type":"text","id":"first_title","label":"Feature column title","default":"What’s included"},
    {"type":"text","id":"launch_title","label":"Launch title","default":"Launch"},
    {"type":"text","id":"growth_title","label":"Growth title","default":"Growth"},
    {"type":"text","id":"scale_title","label":"Scale title","default":"Scale"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"footnote","label":"Footnote","default":"Custom checkout capabilities depend on your Shopify plan and platform eligibility. ‘20+ pages’ and custom integrations are scoped during discovery."},
    {"type":"header","content":"Layout and colors"},
